      "date": "2026-09-26",
      "note": "The nine endpoints these recipes were held on are now registered in catalog/genesys.catalog.json. Paths were confirmed against the MyPureCloud platform-client-sdk-cli generated command set (SWAGGER_OVERRIDE path annotations, which mirror the official Genesys Cloud OpenAPI spec) and cross-checked against the Go/PHP/Java PureCloud SDK method signatures, since developer.genesys.cloud and api.mypurecloud.com are not reachable from this environment's egress proxy. Response shapes and field names are still unvalidated against a live tenant (validationStatus: unvalidated on the new dataset/endpoint entries).",
      "pathCorrections": [
        "externalcontacts.get.contact.journey.sessions and externalcontacts.get.contact.journey.segments use the singular path segment 'journey' (/api/v2/externalcontacts/contacts/{contactId}/journey/sessions|segments), not the plural 'journeys' used in the original held proposal.",
        "analytics.get.botflow.reportingturns (org-wide, /api/v2/analytics/botflows/{botFlowId}/reportingturns) is a distinct endpoint from analytics.get.botflow.divisions.reportingturns (division-scoped, /divisions/reportingturns) — both exist as separate SDK commands and are now both catalogued.",
        "authorization.get.division.grants was already present in the catalog at the path this research independently confirmed (/api/v2/authorization/divisions/{divisionId}/grants); no change needed there."
      ],
